  npcName: Widow Cress
  npcPortrait: {fileID: 3295236706101327806, guid: bcd54170a6108ad438c9e347ff6e5946, type: 3}
  dialogueLines:
  - The flowers drink more than I do, and I'm no stranger to thirst.
  - The well talks in dry summers. Ask anyone old enough to lie about it.
  - My jug's on the sill if your arms are young. The walk to the well gets longer
    every year.
